  Location: /var/ossec/etc/rules/local_rules.xml
  Note: Wazuh usually flags a failed logon as Low severity (Rule 60122). 
  I wrote this custom rule to catch anyone trying to brute-force my honeypot 
  account (HackerTest) and immediately bump the severity to Critical (15).


<group name="windows, custom,">
  <rule id="100001" level="15">
    <if_sid>60122</if_sid>
    <match>HackerTest</match>
    <description>CRITICAL: Targeted brute-force attempt against honeypot account (HackerTest)</description>
  </rule>
</group>